-- 벨트 (D2 벨트): 4칸에 무엇을 넣을지 플레이어가 고른다 — hp 생명 물약 · mp 마나 물약 · rv 회복 물약 · tp 귀환 두루마리 · "" 빈 칸.
-- 칸 사용: PC 숫자 1~4·칸 클릭, 모바일 물약 칸. 칸 지정: PC 칸 우클릭(빈 칸은 클릭), 모바일 「스킬 편집」 중 물약 칸 → SkillPicker 벨트 모드.
-- 귀환 두루마리 개수는 PlayerTravel.TownScroll (상점 구매).
@Component
script PlayerBelt extends Component

    property number PotionCooldown = 0.8
    @Sync
    property integer HpPot = 3
    @Sync
    property integer MpPot = 2
    @Sync
    property integer RvPot = 0
    @Sync
    property string Layout = "hp,mp,rv,"   -- 칸 1~4의 물건 (","로 연결, 빈 칸은 빈 문자열)
    property number ReadyAt = 0

    method string SlotKind(integer index)
        -- index번 칸의 물건 종류 ("" = 빈 칸)
        local i = 0
        for part in string.gmatch(self.Layout .. ",", "([^,]*),") do
            i = i + 1
            if i == index then return part end
        end
        return ""
    end

    method boolean ValidKind(string kind)
        return kind == "" or kind == "hp" or kind == "mp" or kind == "rv" or kind == "tp"
    end

    method integer CountOf(string kind)
        -- 그 물건의 남은 개수 (귀환 두루마리는 PlayerTravel)
        if kind == "hp" then return self.HpPot end
        if kind == "mp" then return self.MpPot end
        if kind == "rv" then return self.RvPot end
        if kind == "tp" then
            ---@type PlayerTravel
            local travel = self.Entity:GetComponent("script.PlayerTravel")
            if travel ~= nil then return travel.TownScroll end
        end
        return 0
    end

    @ExecSpace("ServerOnly")
    method void AddPotion(string kind, integer count)
        if kind == "hp" then self.HpPot = self.HpPot + count
        elseif kind == "mp" then self.MpPot = self.MpPot + count
        elseif kind == "rv" then self.RvPot = self.RvPot + count end
    end

    @ExecSpace("Server")
    method void RequestSetBelt(integer index, string kind)
        -- 칸 지정 (서버 검증). 같은 물건이 다른 칸에 있으면 그 칸은 비운다
        if senderUserId ~= self.Entity.PlayerComponent.UserId or index < 1 or index > 4 or not self:ValidKind(kind) then return end
        local parts = {}
        for i = 1, 4 do
            local current = self:SlotKind(i)
            if i == index then current = kind elseif kind ~= "" and current == kind then current = "" end
            parts[i] = current
        end
        self.Layout = table.concat(parts, ",")
    end

    @ExecSpace("Server")
    method void RequestUseSlot(integer index)
        if senderUserId ~= self.Entity.PlayerComponent.UserId or index < 1 or index > 4 then return end
        local kind = self:SlotKind(index)
        if kind == "" then return end
        if kind == "tp" then
            ---@type PlayerTravel
            local travel = self.Entity:GetComponent("script.PlayerTravel")
            if travel ~= nil then travel:UseTownScroll() end
            return
        end
        self:UsePotion(kind)
    end

    @ExecSpace("Server")
    method void RequestUsePotion(string kind)
        if senderUserId ~= self.Entity.PlayerComponent.UserId then return end
        self:UsePotion(kind)
    end

    @ExecSpace("ServerOnly")
    method boolean UsePotion(string kind)
        -- 회복량은 data/shop.csv hpPct·manaPct (생명 40% / 마나 50% / 회복 35%+35%)
        local pc = self.Entity.PlayerComponent
        if pc.Hp <= 0 then return false end
        local now = _UtilLogic.ElapsedSeconds
        if now < self.ReadyAt then return false end
        ---@type PlayerStats
        local stats = self.Entity:GetComponent("script.PlayerStats")
        if stats == nil then return false end
        local item = _GameData:GetShopItem(kind)
        if item == nil then return false end
        local count = 0
        if kind == "hp" then count = self.HpPot elseif kind == "mp" then count = self.MpPot elseif kind == "rv" then count = self.RvPot end
        if count <= 0 then
            _Util:Notify(item.name .. "이 없다", pc.UserId)
            return false
        end
        if kind == "hp" then self.HpPot = self.HpPot - 1
        elseif kind == "mp" then self.MpPot = self.MpPot - 1
        else self.RvPot = self.RvPot - 1 end
        stats:Heal(pc.MaxHp * item.hpPct / 100, stats.MaxMana * item.manaPct / 100)
        self.ReadyAt = now + self.PotionCooldown
        return true
    end

    @ExecSpace("ClientOnly")
    @EventSender("Service", "InputService")
    handler HandleKeyDownEvent(KeyDownEvent event)
        -- 숫자 1~4 = 벨트 칸 1~4 (무엇이 들었는지는 플레이어가 정한다)
        if self.Entity ~= _UserService.LocalPlayer or not _UIKit:CanUseGameplayInput() then return end
        if event.key == KeyboardKey.Alpha1 then self:RequestUseSlot(1)
        elseif event.key == KeyboardKey.Alpha2 then self:RequestUseSlot(2)
        elseif event.key == KeyboardKey.Alpha3 then self:RequestUseSlot(3)
        elseif event.key == KeyboardKey.Alpha4 then self:RequestUseSlot(4) end
    end

    @ExecSpace("ServerOnly")
    method table GetSaveData()
        return { hp = self.HpPot, mp = self.MpPot, rv = self.RvPot, lay = self.Layout }
    end

    @ExecSpace("ServerOnly")
    method void LoadSaveData(table d)
        if d == nil then return end
        self.HpPot = d.hp or 0
        self.MpPot = d.mp or 0
        self.RvPot = d.rv or 0
        -- 예전 저장(칸 고정)은 물약 3칸 + 빈 4번 칸으로 시작한다
        if type(d.lay) == "string" then self.Layout = d.lay else self.Layout = "hp,mp,rv," end
    end

end
